    "homepage": {
      "status": 200,
      "body": "\n\n\n<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd\">\n<html>\n<head>\n<META http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n<meta content=\"PSYHO design : www.psyho.ua\" name=\"author\">\n<meta content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\">\n<title>pp.ua - free domain for people!</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/style.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/i/favicon.ico\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/i/favicon.ico\">\n<script src=\"/js/lib.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" language=\"JavaScript\"></script><script src=\"https://www.google.com/recaptcha/api.js?hl=en\"></script><script type=\"text/javascript\"><!--\n//--></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"\" onload=\"ppDocumentLoad();\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<div class=\"logo\">\n<a href=\"/eng/index.html\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"32px\" width=\"162px\" src=\"/i/logo.gif\"></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"menu\">\n<div class=\"item small\">\n<a href=\"https://drs.ua/en/signing/\">Become<br>a registrar</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item small\">\n<a href=\"/eng/policy.html\">Rules<br>domain</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item big confirm\">\n<a onclick=\"ppShowCloud('confirm'); return event.returnValue=false;\" href=\"/eng/confirm.html\">activate<br>domain</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item big how_to\">\n<a onclick=\"ppShowCloud('how_to'); return event.returnValue=false;\" href=\"/eng/howto.html\">how can<br>register</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script language=\"JavaScript\" type=\"text/javascript\"><!--\n        var ppQwotes=new Array(\n            { 'qwote': '<p>I am a businessman trying out innovative services on the Internet. The mail was created on my new domain .pp.ua, and this helped my business a lot.</p><p>It turned out that you can get a domain and mail for free,and to create a website for my company on it. The business develops without additional costs, and this is very important in the complex realities of modern life.</p>', 'bg': 'bg_1' },\n            { 'qwote': '<p>Hello!<br/>I love cooking and sharing what happened on my blog :-) </p><p>/When I registered the domain, I included redirects to my blog where I share various tried-and-true recipes.. Now it is much easier for me to say the address of my website than the long address of a free blog. ;-* </p>', 'bg': 'bg_4' },\n            { 'qwote': '<p>The Internet for me  is above all about  communication. A free domain has opened up new opportunities for me.</p><p>Soon I will have at least my own website and personal mail,  but it turns out I can also have my own domain to host a server, file sharing service, telephone exchange, and more. .</p><p>In short, I still have a lot to learn :)</p>', 'bg': 'bg_2' },\n            { 'qwote': '<p>Photo &#8212; this is my job. Many news agencies use my photos as illustrations for their reports.</p><p>​​But it is impossible to show everything you want in a reportage. I publish the most interesting photos in my photo gallery.</p><p>I already have several thousand beautiful photos on any topic in my gallery.</p>', 'bg': 'bg_5' },\n            { 'qwote': '<p>I love meeting people online.<br/>When meeting people, it is easier to say the address of your website, which has a lot of information. This will not only allow you to tell most fully about yourself, but also make an impression. O:-) ;-) </p><p>I am still creating a website, I registered the pp.ua domain for free, I also found hosting for free.</p>', 'bg': 'bg_3' },\n            { 'qwote': '<p>Music &#8212; this is my life! I am a radio DJ.</p><p>The domain allows me to host my own podcasts, share mp3 releases and more!</p><p>p.s. yes &#8212; you hear me in the evenings on the radio...</p>', 'bg': 'bg_6' },\n            { 'qwote': '<p> I like taking pictures of myself and&nbsp;taking some photos. But &nbsp;to a greater extent, of course, I act as a model, and&nbsp;as a photographer&nbsp;&#8212; while a beginner.</p>', 'bg': 'bg_7' }\n        );\n        var ppQwotesId=0;\n    //--></script>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<div class=\"cloud how_to\">\n<div class=\"inner inner_fill\">\n<img class=\"clt\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"crt\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"clb\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"crb\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><div class=\"body\">\n<p>To register a domain, first check the availability of the domain on the website <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://dig.ua\">dig.ua</a>. If the domain does not belong to anyone, then the search will not return a result, otherwise you will see data about who registered the specified domain.</p>\n<p>A domain available for registration can be registered on the website of one of the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://drs.ua/en/registrars/\">Accredited registrars</a>.  Choose the registrar you feel most comfortable working with, go to their website and apply for the domain you want.</p>\n<p>Once you have registered a domain with an Accredited Registrar, it will not start working until you <a href=\"/eng/confirm.html\">have confirmed the domain registration</a>.\nA confirmation code is sent by SMSto your mobile phone, after confirmation, the previously registered domain is delegated. Otherwise, if the domain is not verified, it will be deleted after 5 days from the date of registration.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"btns\">\n<input onclick=\"ppHideCloud(); return event.returnValue=false;\" value=\"Закрыть\" type=\"button\">\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cloud confirm\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\" class=\"inner inner_fill\">\n<img class=\"clt\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"crt\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"clb\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"crb\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><div class=\"body\">\n<div style=\"color: black;font-size: 16px;\" class=\"row\">\n<p>Для активації домену кодом з SMS перейдіть будь ласка на <a style=\"color: #258cc7;\" href=\"https://apu.drs.ua/uk/\">новий модуль активації</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\" class=\"inner inner_fill\">\n<img class=\"clt\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"crt\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"clb\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"crb\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><div class=\"body\">\n<div style=\"color: black;font-size: 16px;\" class=\"row\">\n<p>Для активации домена кодом из SMS перейдите пожалуйста на <a style=\"color: #258cc7;\" href=\"https://apu.drs.ua/ru/\">новый модуль активации</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\" class=\"inner inner_fill\">\n<img class=\"clt\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"crt\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"clb\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"crb\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><div class=\"body\">\n<div style=\"color: black;font-size: 16px;\" class=\"row\">\n<p>To activate domain by SMS key, please go to <a style=\"color: #258cc7;\" href=\"https://apu.drs.ua/en/\">new activation module</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"link\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://dig.ua\">check another domain</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qwote\">\n<div class=\"title\">Why this domain to other people:</div>\n<div class=\"qbox\">\n<div style=\"visibility: hidden;\" id=\"ppQwote\" class=\"inner inner_fill\">\n<img class=\"clt\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"crt\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"clb\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img class=\"crb\" alt=\"\" height=\"18px\" width=\"18px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"><img id=\"ppQwoteBl\" style=\"display: none;\" class=\"bl\" alt=\"\" height=\"125px\" width=\"20px\" src=\"/i/qwote-l.gif\"><img id=\"ppQwoteBr\" style=\"display: none;\" class=\"br\" alt=\"\" height=\"137px\" width=\"22px\" src=\"/i/qwote-r.gif\"><div id=\"ppQwoteAr\" style=\"display: none;\" class=\"arrow\">\n<span onclick=\"ppNextBegin()\">&rarr;</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"body\">\n<div id=\"ppQwoteText\"></div>\n<p>А <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://dig.ua\">is your domain</a> still free?</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"partners\">\n<div class=\"title\">Accredited <a href=\"https://drs.ua/en/registrars/\">registrars</a>:</div>\n<div class=\"list\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nic.ua\"><img class=\"partner nic\" alt=\"\" height=\"25px\" width=\"72px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://regnames.com.ua/\"><img class=\"partner regnames\" alt=\"\" height=\"22px\" width=\"74px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://pg.zp.ua\"><img class=\"partner pg\" alt=\"\" height=\"15px\" width=\"56px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://hostpro.ua\"><img class=\"partner hostpro\" alt=\"\" height=\"20px\" width=\"43px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://mesto.zp.ua\"><img class=\"partner mesto_zp_ua\" alt=\"\" height=\"25px\" width=\"63px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ukrhosting.com\"><img class=\"partner ukrhosting\" alt=\"\" height=\"25px\" width=\"85px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://prostohosting.com\"><img class=\"partner prosto-hosting\" alt=\"\" height=\"25px\" width=\"89px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height:0;\" class=\"delimiter\" id=\"ppDelim\">\n<img alt=\"\" height=\"0px\" width=\"1px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"></div>\n<div class=\"footer\">\n<div id=\"ppBg\" class=\"bg\"></div>\n<div class=\"bx\">\n<div class=\"copy\">\n<div class=\"so_l\">&copy;&nbsp;2009 - 2026&nbsp;Service&nbsp;Online</div>\n<div class=\"so_r\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.so.ua\"><img title=\"SO\" alt=\"SO\" height=\"27px\" width=\"127px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fb\">\n<div class=\"psyho\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.psyho.ua\"><img title=\"PSYHO\" alt=\"PSYHO\" height=\"76px\" width=\"50px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"></a>\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\"><!--\nvar gaJsHost = ((\"https:\" == document.location.protocol) ? \"https://ssl.\" : \"http://www.\");\ndocument.write(unescape(\"%3Cscript src='\" + gaJsHost + \"google-analytics.com/ga.js' type='text/javascript'%3E%3C/script%3E\"));\n//--></script><script type=\"text/javascript\"><!--\ntry {\nvar pageTracker = _gat._getTracker(\"UA-376903-12\");\npageTracker._trackPageview();\n} catch(err) {}\n//--></script>\n<div class=\"question\">\n<p>Is something unclear?</p>\n<p>Accredited <a href=\"https://drs.ua/en/registrars/\">registrars</a> are always happy to help you.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tweeter\">\n<div class=\"pic\">\n<img alt=\"\" height=\"30px\" width=\"43px\" src=\"/i/z.gif\"></div>\n<div class=\"time\">Want to stay up to date?</div>\n<div class=\"text\">The latest news about the pp.ua domain can<br>follow our twitter.</div>\n<div class=\"link\">\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/pp_ua\">Follow us on Twitter</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
